    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61997" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάσᾰνα</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λᾰ], τά</span>, (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάανα</span>) always in pl., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>trivet</i> or <i>stand for a pot</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				893
			</span></i> (ubi v. Sch.), <i><span class="en">
